e per admitted root or disconnected subgraph\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1788:  one canonical value per batch. The shape must be fixed with the REPL\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1824:1. **Type-preserving canonical encoding in `dao.jing`** — declared,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1910:    map` is the identity on the canonical map AST and `rows → map →\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md:1912:    tested over the corpus before any row set is treated as canonical.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
